                        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="2f86-c8b4-b3b4-3ff9">Heavy 1, 10&quot; Blast, Ordnance, Graviton Collapse* Concussive (3)</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Graviton Collapse" id="4fb9-326e-c423-4863" hidden="false">
                      <description>Against Vehicles / Super-Heavies / Walkers: Roll 1D6 per hit. On a 2–4, the target suffers a Glancing Hit. On a 5–6, the target suffers a Penetrating Hit. Additionally, force successful Invulnerable Saves to be re-rolled.


Against Non-Vehicle Units: Models hit must pass a Strength Test at -2 or immediately lose 1 Wound (no armor/cover saves permitted).


Crush Fortifications: Ignores cover and inflicts double Hull Point damage to Buildings and Fortifications.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
